#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md:6
msgid "Mutually Exclusive References / \"Aliasing XOR Mutability\""
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/borrow-checker-invariants/aliasing-xor-mutability.md:8
msgid ""
"We can use the mutual exclusion of `&T` and `&mut T` references to prevent "
"data from being used before it is ready."
msgstr ""

